@	
o	--help|-h	Show help for gron	
o	-u|--ungron	Reverse the operation (turn assignments back into JSON)	
o	-v|--values	Print just the values of provided assignments	
o	-c|--colorize	Colorize output (default on tty)	
o	-m|--monochrome	Monochrome (don't colorize output)	
o	-s|--stream	Treat each line of input as a separate JSON object	
o	-k|--insecure	Disable certificate validation	
o	-j|--json	Represent gron data as JSON stream	
o	--no-sort	Don't sort output (faster)	
o	--version	Print version information	
